<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>French Bulldog Guides in English | BulldogFrances.com</title><meta name="description" content="English-language French Bulldog owner guides, currently in editorial review."><style>body{margin:0;background:#f6f7f8;color:#182838;font:16px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}header,main,footer{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:20px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}a{color:#185179}h1,h2{font-family:Georgia,serif}.notice{background:#fff6dc;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #c08a25;border-radius:6px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:25px}.card{display:block;background:white;border:1px solid #e0e5e8;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;text-decoration:none}.card strong{display:block;color:#172d43}.card small{color:#586774}footer{border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:40px}</style></head><body><header><a href="/">BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</a><nav><a href="/en/">English home</a> · <a href="/es/">Español</a></nav></header><main><h1>French Bulldog owner guides</h1><p class="notice"><strong>Editorial preview.</strong> These 24 English-language guides were recovered from the MyPetsFamily working archive. They are unreviewed drafts, not veterinary-approved advice. Images, references and internal links are still being prepared.</p><div class="grid">{articles.map(a=><a class="card" href={'/en/guides/'+a.folder+'/'}><strong>{title(a.folder)}</strong><small>{a.topic} · Draft</small></a>)}</div></main><footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} BulldogFrances.com · <a href="/en/">Home</a></footer></body></html>